+    "The cases show intermediate facts and selections, not the response schema. Their raw_value/evidence preserve source wording; normalised_label illustrates label conversion. Populate answer.label with the case's answer label, or the selected fact's normalised_label when no new label is given. Always declare the answer label, including unknown and no seizure frequency reference, and copy its supporting quotation into answer.evidence. Only no-reference has null evidence.",
